# Language Rule: English Only

**All written content in this project must be in English.**

## Scope

- **Rules** (`.mdc`): Descriptions, titles, and body content
- **Skills** (SKILL.md): Descriptions, instructions, examples
- **Documentation**: README, ARCHITECTURE, AGENTS.md, comments
- **Code**: Comments, docstrings, variable names, string literals
- **UI**: User-facing labels, messages, button text

## Rationale

- Consistency across contributors and tooling
- Broader accessibility for international collaboration
- Standard practice in open-source and professional projects
- AI and static analysis tools work best with a single language

## Enforcement

- Do not add Turkish or other non-English content
- When creating new files, write in English
- When editing existing content, translate any non-English text to English
